iteboard, outlets, and windows over Bulldog Alley and Herak Lawn.","source_url":"https://www.gonzaga.edu/news-events/stories/gonzaga-students-favorite-spots-on-campus","source_title":"Gonzaga Students' Favorite Spots on Campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use only during authorized Hughes Hall access and avoid disrupting nearby laboratories and offices.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gonzaga-foley-digital-scholarship-lab","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Digital Scholarship Lab","title":"Prototype a Digital or Hands-On Project","subtitle":"Creative technology workspace on Foley Library's lower level","notes":"Bring a defined project idea, ask student staff which tool fits it, and confirm current training, scheduling, and material requirements first.","short_summary":"The lower-level lab supports digital inquiry, making, experimentation, and project guidance.","evidence_claim":"Gonzaga locates the Digital Scholarship Lab on Foley Library's lower level and describes it as an exploratory space for students and faculty using emerging technologies.","source_url":"https://www.gonzaga.edu/foley-library/services/digital-scholarship-and-publishing","source_title":"Digital Scholarship and Publishing","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Confirm current lab availability, equipment training, reservations, and any material charges before starting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gonzaga-foley-group-study-rooms","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Foley Library Group Study Rooms","title":"Reserve a Room for the Noisy Part","subtitle":"Bookable second-floor rooms for collaborative coursework","notes":"Reserve the needed time at the circulation d